>   Then what would be the drive for you to make a user take an obscene image
>off the screen? Hopefully it is because you really believe it is causing a
>hostile atmosphere for some other users, and interfereing with thier work.

You're starting to catch on.

>  In a large part, many people fear the buziness of policy enforcers.

Their personal problems aren't my fault.  [BTW, the phrase "Policy
