You were doing fine until your last sentence.  While it's true that most
of us are not forbidden by some official policy from posting whatever
trash we please anywhere we please, there is such a thing as good manners,
respect for conventions, etc.  Most net users have repeatedly expressed
the sentiment that they don't want to see blatant advertising in groups
that weren't set up for that purpose.  If you violate this, you probably
won't be violating the law -- but you'll be generating so much hostility
that it isn't worth the bother.

